  supported languages - Android falls back to English per string, so every
  screen stays usable, but these should be reviewed by native speakers before
  submission. They live in their own file with the lint check suppressed so
  that MissingTranslation keeps working for res/values/strings.xml, which IS
  fully translated.
-->
